Subject: [PATCH v6 15/51] x86/tsc: Kill off x86_platform_ops.calibrate_{cpu,tsc}()
 hooks
From: Sean Christopherson <seanjc@google.com>
To: Kiryl Shutsemau <kas@kernel.org>, Rick Edgecombe <rick.p.edgecombe@intel.com>, 
